OL,3,ABarclays cutting 5,000 jobs as it
OL,4,Aincreases reliance on AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarclays said the changes were the
OL,7,Fresult of an ongoing modernisation
OL,8,Fplan, with the use of AI being the
OL,9,F"icing on the cake" of its strategy.
